  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:320px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Gray pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Color Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4a/Slurp_Guy_%28Paper_Mario%29_suck_color.gif/revision/latest?cb=20191204015301\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Slurp Guy (Paper Mario) suck color\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4a/Slurp_Guy_%28Paper_Mario%29_suck_color.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20191204015301\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4a/Slurp_Guy_%28Paper_Mario%29_suck_color.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20191204015301 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4a/Slurp_Guy_%28Paper_Mario%29_suck_color.gif/revision/latest?cb=20191204015301 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Slurp Guy (Paper Mario) suck color\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Slurp_Guy_%28Paper_Mario%29_suck_color.gif\" data-image-name=\"Slurp Guy (Paper Mario) suck color.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">A Slurp Guy (Paper Mario: Color Splash) draining a Toad's color.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb color.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"I still taste overtones of pink!\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Homer Simpson (The Simpsons)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb color and utilize it in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Color_Manipulation\" title=\"Color Manipulation\">Color Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Absorption\" title=\"Light Absorption\">Light Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Known_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FColor_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Black and White/Colorless Inducement</li>\n<li>Color Drain/Draining</li>\n<li>Color Erasure</li>\n<li>Chromokinetic/Chromakinetic Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FColor_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb colors, while removing it from the source and rendering the target colorless and grey, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as a power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FColor_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Affinity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Affinity\">Affinity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Color_Consumption\" title=\"Color Consumption\">Color Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FColor_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Color_Manipulation\" title=\"Color Manipulation\">Color Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_Manipulation\" title=\"Darkness Manipulation\">Darkness Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ink_Manipulation\" title=\"Ink Manipulation\">Ink Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Manipulation\" title=\"Light Manipulation\">Light Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Miming\" title=\"Miming\">Miming</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nothingness_Manipulation\" title=\"Nothingness Manipulation\">Nothingness Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Paint_Manipulation\" title=\"Paint Manipulation\">Paint Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rainbow_Manipulation\" title=\"Rainbow Manipulation\">Rainbow Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Silence_Manipulation\" title=\"Silence Manipulation\">Silence Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FColor_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FColor_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Blob (<i>de Blob</i>)</li>\n<li>INKT Corporation (<i>de Blob</i>)</li>\n<li>Comrade Black (<i>de Blob</i>)</li>\n<li>Inkies (<i>de Blob</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://adventuretime.fandom.com/wiki/Marceline\">Marceline the Vampire Queen</a> (<i>Adventure Time</i>); only red</li>\n<li>Phantom Blot (<i>House of Mouse</i>)</li>\n<li>Sting Eucliffe (<i>Fairy Tail</i>); anything white</li>\n<li>Princess Ivy (<i>Sofia the First</i>); via her butterflies</li>\n<li>Octopuses (<i>Hero 108</i>)</li>\n<li>White Bear Monster (<i>Nurse Witch Komugi-chan R</i>)</li>\n<li>Most Enemies (<i>Paper Mario: Color Splash</i>)\n<ul><li>Slurp Guy</li></ul></li>\n<li>Artistmole (<i>Mighty Morphin Power Rangers</i>)</li>\n<li>Dark Crafter (<i>Kirby and the Rainbow Curse</i>)</li>\n<li>Discord (<i>My Little Pony: Friendship is Magic</i>); only ponies</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://drawntolife.fandom.com/wiki/Wilfre#Misc.\">Wilfre</a> (<i>Drawn to Life</i>)</li>\n<li>Gulusgammamon (<i>Digimon Ghost Game</i>)</li>\n<li>Chroma (<i>My Magic Pet Morphle</i>)</li>\n<li>Nixels (<i>Mixels</i>)</li>\n<li>Devil (<i>Antonblast</i>)</li>\n<li>Kay (<i>Colorist</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FColor_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Fader Wand (<i>Wild Kratts</i>)</li>\n<li>Color Nullifier (<i>SpongeBob SquarePants</i>)</li>\n<li>Bleach (<i>Clorox</i>)</li>\n<li>Rainbow Rocks (<i>Penn Zero: Part-Time Hero</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Locations\">Known Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FColor_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=a